#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:3 82da22901c204af5b8bcfc0e0cc2c992
msgid "Fedora templates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:5 03b322d4e17c4a978f1cbcb569fd0e75
msgid ""
"The Fedora Xfce :doc:`template </user/templates/templates>` is the default "
"template in Qubes OS. The current supported versions are :ref:`Fedora 43 and "
"Fedora 44 <user/downloading-installing-upgrading/supported-releases:"
"Templates>`. **This page is about the \"full\" Fedora templates** (with a "
"name ending in ``-43``, ``-xfce`` or ``-gnome``). For the minimal version, "
"please see the :doc:`Minimal templates </user/templates/minimal-templates>` "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:7 4185facf7b4f41fbaecc856a31deb2d4
msgid "4.3 and Fedora 44"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/fedora/fedora.rst:9 c4ad2d1cf2544112bd5980be956e885e
msgid ""
"Starting with Fedora 44 (in Qubes 4.3), the Gnome template is named :samp:"
"`fedora-{XX}-gnome` where :samp:`{XX}` is the version number. It was "
"previously named :samp:`fedora-{XX}`."
msgstr ""

